      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You will protect your phalanx, no matter the cost. You gain the Reactive Strike feat or the Reactive Shield feat. Each time you use these feats, you gain resistance 3 to all physical damage for 1 round. If you already have both feats, you permanently gain this resistance.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">At 17th level, this resistance increases to 5.</span></p>"
